      "content": "The housing and banking sectors are not just perpetuating racial disparities; they're actively engaged in a war against equality. Neoliberal policies have stripped away the safety nets that once protected marginalized communities, leaving them vulnerable to predatory practices. The privatization of public housing and the deregulation of the banking industry have created a hostile environment for people of color, who are systematically denied equal opportunities. It's time to recognize that these sectors are not just failing to serve all Americans fairly—they're actively working against it. We must challenge these institutions and demand a restructuring that prioritizes equity and justice for all.",
